      conversation: You mean the mail from the Headquarters of the Finance Department? Hmm... I actually had this kind of documents before; but I'm not sure where I placed it. Ah! It’s here. It looks like a simple document, however, it was personally requested by the Student Director I think he has little trust on students. What is important is that the document is still here.
