    basicConversation:
    - id: 0
      conversation: Please consider if you could do me a favor it and deliver this medicine to that fella. The Health Advisor has ordered several times the recovery of the first-aid medicine as soon as possible. So please accept my request again. There are fellas known as the Blood Drinkers. They rob people who posses the medicine. It is evident that these Blood Drinkers have the medicines. Please ensure that the people will never be robbed again.
